### 1. Get All Active Staff (GET)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/staff

### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Add a New Staff Member (POST)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "Maria Santos",
  "role": "Coordinator",
  "availability": "Available",
  "healthStatus": "Fit to Work",
  "address": "Manila",
  "contact": "09987654321"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Edit Staff Details (PUT)
# (Replace the UUID with an actual employeeID from your database or from the POST response above)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/staff/67cb7fe4-0b86-4877-9265-340da75a271a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availability": "On Leave",
  "contact": "09111222333"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 4. Deactivate Staff / Soft Delete (DELETE)
# (Replace the UUID with an actual employeeID)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/staff/67cb7fe4-0b86-4877-9265-340da75a271a

### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 5. Add a New Truck (POST)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/trucks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "XYZ-9876",
  "truckType": "Box",
  "capacity": 4000,
  "truckStatus": "Available"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Get All Active Trucks (GET)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/trucks

### ---------------------------------------------------------
### CLIENT MANAGEMENT API
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Add a New Client (POST)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Acme Manufacturing",
  "contactPerson": "John Doe",
  "contactNumber": "09123456789",
  "address": "Makati City",
  "contractStart": "2026-08-01",
  "contractEnd": "2027-08-01"
}

### 8. Get All Active Clients (GET)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/clients


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### SUBCONTRACTOR API
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 9. Add a New Subcontractor (POST)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/subcontractors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "FastTrack Logistics",
  "contactPerson": "Jane Smith",
  "contactNumber": "09876543210"
}

### 10. Get All Active Subcontractors (GET)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/subcontractors


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### MAINTENANCE API
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### 11. Get All Maintenance Logs (GET)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/maintenance

### Note: To test the Maintenance POST request, you will need to copy 
### an actual 'truckID' and 'mechanicID' from your database, as Supabase 
### will reject fake IDs due to strict foreign key relations!

### Complete a Delivery
POST http://localhost:3001/api/dispatch/YOUR_DISPATCH_ID_HERE/complete

### Upload Proof of Delivery (Multipart Form)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/dispatch/YOUR_DISPATCH_ID/pod
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="podImage"; filename="delivery_receipt.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/local/test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

