### Register a Test Coordinator
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coordinator@logisco.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "employeeName": "Vince Test",
  "role": "Coordinator",
  "address": "Calamba, Laguna",
  "contact": "09123456789"
}

### Register an Admin
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@logisco.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "employeeName": "Admin User",
  "role": "Admin",
  "address": "Calamba, Laguna",
  "contact": "09123456789"
}

### Get All Employees
GET http://localhost:3001/api/employees

